{"ts": "2026-08-25T12:46:50+08:00", "text": "其实我也觉得晚上喝奶茶可能不太好。", "emotion": "平静", "confidence": 0.72, "hint": "她在理性地自我说服，语气平稳而略带犹豫。", "features": {"duration_s": 5.5, "pitch_hz": 223.1, "pitch_range": 75.1, "energy": 0.045, "energy_sway": 0.0298, "pause_ratio": 0.22, "tempo": 2.41, "tempo_sway": 2.64, "brightness": 2111.0, "pitch_jitter": 0.1611}, "relative": {}, "audio": "", "speaker": "主人", "similarity": null, "env_sounds": []}
