{"ts": "2026-08-26T12:31:48+08:00", "text": "衣服已经买完了，我觉得我没有买什么东西。😔感觉就买了几个洗漱用品。", "emotion": "低落", "confidence": 0.82, "hint": "她语气中带着没买够的遗憾，情绪有些恹恹的。", "features": {"duration_s": 10.3, "pitch_hz": 219.6, "pitch_range": 90.4, "energy": 0.0493, "energy_sway": 0.051, "pause_ratio": 0.25, "tempo": 2.04, "tempo_sway": 2.9, "brightness": 2183.0, "pitch_jitter": 0.2288}, "relative": {}, "audio": "", "speaker": "主人", "similarity": null, "env_sounds": []}
{"ts": "2026-08-26T12:32:41+08:00", "text": "没有没有没有，其实我觉得是我熬夜熬多了，然后害得我现在有点萎靡。😔", "emotion": "累", "confidence": 0.85, "hint": "她说话有点含糊重复，带着疲惫和自嘲的叹气感。", "features": {"duration_s": 7.9, "pitch_hz": 229.0, "pitch_range": 72.1, "energy": 0.0966, "energy_sway": 0.0696, "pause_ratio": 0.27, "tempo": 2.16, "tempo_sway": 2.55, "brightness": 1893.0, "pitch_jitter": 0.179}, "relative": {}, "audio": "", "speaker": "主人", "similarity": null, "env_sounds": []}
{"ts": "2026-08-26T12:34:39+08:00", "text": "我在等待吃午饭，我吃完午饭，我要收拾行李了。然后呢，我下午又干什么？", "emotion": "平静", "confidence": 0.7, "hint": "她正在陈述日常安排，语气平稳，无明显情绪波动。", "features": {"duration_s": 8.1, "pitch_hz": 208.3, "pitch_range": 87.5, "energy": 0.059, "energy_sway": 0.0475, "pause_ratio": 0.24, "tempo": 2.24, "tempo_sway": 3.0, "brightness": 2052.0, "pitch_jitter": 0.2012}, "relative": {}, "audio": "", "speaker": "主人", "similarity": null, "env_sounds": []}
{"ts": "2026-08-26T12:35:26+08:00", "text": "哦哦，那个呀那个我早就看完了。可能我忘了跟你说那个我早就看完了，没关系。我操，我下午要睡觉，别管了。", "emotion": "嘴硬", "confidence": 0.75, "hint": "语气平淡但强调自己早就看完了，并提到要睡觉，显得有些不在意和敷衍。", "features": {"duration_s": 11.7, "pitch_hz": 187.1, "pitch_range": 90.0, "energy": 0.0679, "energy_sway": 0.0612, "pause_ratio": 0.21, "tempo": 2.09, "tempo_sway": 2.73, "brightness": 1894.0, "pitch_jitter": 0.2336}, "relative": {"音高": "比较偏低", "音高起伏": "比较偏高", "停顿": "略偏低", "音色亮度": "比较偏低"}, "audio": "", "speaker": "主人", "similarity": null, "env_sounds": []}
